      "quote": "Expects custom accelerators at the two largest clouds to reach \"roughly a third of new accelerator dollars\" by late 2027; would not give a 2026 figure."
    }
  ],
  "investigation": {
    "question": "Do Google TPU and Amazon Trainium ramps displace more NVIDIA spending in calendar Q4 2026 than the held 65% annual share and 127 fiscal Q4 estimate assume?",
    "reason": "The analyst challenge requires dated procurement and recognition, a substitution counterfactual, customer/concentration mapping and reconciliation with the existing timing allowance.",
