      "TPU Trainium Q4 2026 shipment deployment procurement NVIDIA",
      "TPU internal capacity 2026 inference training infrastructure",
      "Trainium3 Trainium2 2026 available capacity deployment",
      "NVIDIA AWS Google Cloud Rubin deliveries 2026",
      "Refreshed Google/Amazon SEC submissions; reviewed latest post-results8Ks",
      "Attempted Alphabet Q2 event URL;404. Alphabet IR root/Amazon quarterly pages returned navigation shells",
      "Compared initiation/channel rationale with current evidence; compute-tested raw and paired0.5/1point share reductions"
    ],
